---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Privacy Policy | Ekansh Homoeopathic Clinic"
  description="Privacy Policy and patient health data protection practices at Ekansh Homoeopathic Clinic, Rajsamand, Rajasthan."
  activeNav="privacy"
>
  <main class="privacy-page">
    <!-- Hero / Header Section -->
    <section class="privacy-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="badge badge-sage">Patient Data Protection</span>
        <h1 class="privacy-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="privacy-lead">
          Ekansh Homoeopathic Clinic is committed to safeguarding the privacy and confidentiality of our patients, visitors, and website users in full alignment with medical ethics.
        </p>
        <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: November 2026 &bull; Kankroli, Rajsamand, Rajasthan</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Content Section -->
    <section class="privacy-body-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="privacy-card card-editorial">
          
          <div class="policy-block">
            <h2>1. Introduction &amp; Commitment</h2>
            <p>
              At Ekansh Homoeopathic Clinic ("we", "us", or "our"), located in Rajsamand, Rajasthan, we uphold the highest standard of doctor-patient confidentiality. This Privacy Policy details how we handle, collect, and protect information submitted through our website (<a href="/">ekansh-clinic-website.vercel.app</a>), our online consultation request forms, and incoming patient inquiries.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="policy-block">
            <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>We collect only the minimum necessary information required to coordinate your clinical appointments and respond to your health queries:</p>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Personal Contact Information:</strong> Full name, telephone/WhatsApp contact number, and email address.</li>
              <li><strong>Appointment Logistics:</strong> Desired consultation modality (in-clinic at Rajsamand or online tele-consultation), preferred dates, and morning or evening time preferences.</li>
              <li><strong>Clinical Notes &amp; Health Concerns:</strong> Any voluntary summary of health symptoms, previous conditions, or reasons for seeking homeopathic care shared in our intake forms.</li>
              <li><strong>Technical Logs:</strong> Minimal non-identifiable technical data (such as browser type and timestamp) processed automatically to protect site integrity.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="policy-block">
            <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>Your information is used strictly for legitimate clinical and administrative purposes:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>To evaluate, schedule, and confirm appointment requests with our consulting physicians.</li>
              <li>To send essential transactional notifications (such as appointment confirmation emails or scheduling updates).</li>
              <li>To answer patient queries submitted through our contact channels.</li>
              <li>To maintain accurate patient consultation files in compliance with classical homoeopathic case-taking practices.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="highlight-box">
              <strong>Strict Non-Disclosure Guarantee:</strong> We never sell, rent, monetize, or trade patient personal details or health information with third-party advertisers or commercial marketing agencies.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="policy-block">
            <h2>4. Doctor-Patient Confidentiality &amp; Medical Ethics</h2>
            <p>
              All health concerns, case histories, and symptom descriptions shared with our physicians are treated as privileged and confidential medical communications. Our clinical intake strictly respects standard medical privacy and ethical standards governing homeopathic practitioners in India.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="policy-block">
            <h2>5. Secure Infrastructure &amp; Third-Party Services</h2>
            <p>We work with trusted technical infrastructure providers to operate our digital clinic desk:</p>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Database Storage (Supabase):</strong> Consultation requests and contact records are stored securely in access-restricted, encrypted databases with strict server-side authentication.</li>
              <li><strong>Transactional Email (Resend):</strong> Transactional email delivery services are utilized exclusively to dispatch official desk decisions (such as appointment acceptances or status updates).</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="policy-block">
            <h2>6. Data Retention &amp; Patient Rights</h2>
            <p>
              Clinical intake records and correspondence are retained only as long as necessary to coordinate ongoing patient care and fulfill professional medical documentation obligations.
            </p>
            <div class="retention-notice">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
                <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"></line>
              </svg>
              <span>
                <strong>Administrative Policy Notice:</strong> Specific record retention schedules and formal record deletion procedures are administered by the clinic reception desk. Patients wishing to verify, update, or request deletion of their contact records may contact our office directly.
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="policy-block">
            <h2>7. External Links &amp; Communications Channels</h2>
            <p>
              Our website links to official external platforms, including our direct WhatsApp messaging desk and our official Instagram profile (<a href="https://www.instagram.com/ekanshhomeo/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@ekanshhomeo</a>). Please note that once you transition to external platforms, their respective privacy policies govern your interactions.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="policy-block">
            <h2>8. Contact the Clinic Desk</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or your data, please contact us directly:</p>
            <div class="contact-details-box">
              <p><strong>Ekansh Homoeopathic Clinic</strong></p>
              <p>Near Vijay Travels, Vivekanand Choraya, Bhilwara Road, Kankroli, Rajsamand – 313324, Rajasthan, India</p>
              <p>Phone: <a href="tel:+919799988138">+91 9799988138</a> &bull; <a href="tel:+919521646525">+91 9521646525</a></p>
              <p>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/919799988138" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">+91 9799988138</a></p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="policy-footer-nav">
            <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">&larr; Return to Home</a>
            <a href="/book-consultation" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Book Consultation &rarr;</a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-page {
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .privacy-hero {
    background-color: var(--color-forest);
    color: var(--color-ivory);
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem) 0 3rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .privacy-hero .badge {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    color: var(--color-sage-light);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .privacy-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    color: var(--color-white);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .privacy-lead {
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.8vw, 1.1rem);
    color: rgba(246, 245, 239, 0.85);
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .last-updated {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-gold-light);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .privacy-body-section {
    margin-top: -1.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-card {
    background: var(--color-white);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .policy-block {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-beige);
  }

  .policy-block:last-of-type {
    border-bottom: none;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .policy-block h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--color-forest);
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .policy-block p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .policy-block ul {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem 1.25rem;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .policy-block li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .policy-block a {
    color: var(--color-forest);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .highlight-box {
    background-color: var(--color-ivory);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-sage);
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem !important;
    color: var(--color-forest) !important;
  }

  .retention-notice {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    background-color: #fcf9f0;
    border: 1px solid #faeec7;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #665214;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .retention-notice svg {
    color: var(--color-gold);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .contact-details-box {
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-beige);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .contact-details-box p {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .contact-details-box p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .policy-footer-nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-beige);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .privacy-card {
      padding: 1.25rem 1.15rem;
    }

    .policy-block ul {
      margin-left: 1rem;
    }

    .policy-footer-nav {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .policy-footer-nav .btn {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>